  "title": "Gekijouban Aquarion",
  "justification": "AniDB special S2 (2008-12-05) has no TVDB episode, was 0x02. AniDB dates from the AniDB mirror at 7dd9b8e; TVDB from its official order. The film (2007-09-22) is TVDB season 0 episode 4 \"Aquarion Movie: Ippatsu Gyakuten Hen\" (劇場版アクエリオン -創星神話篇\u0026壱発逆転篇-, 2007-09-22); the row sent it to episode 3 \"The Wings of Glory\", the second OVA, since TVDB put the EVOL OVA at episode 1. On TMDB 8872 season 0, special S2 \"Episode 27 Parallel Edition\" (2008-12-05) is episode 3 \"Dai 27-wa Parallel-ban\" (2008-12-05); the film and S1 are not listed and had fallen on the two OVAs, so they are unmapped there.",
